  "details": "Just yesterday (more like 2 days ago at 11-9-2022) i got weird layer bug.\nI know the menu is build of many panels (as layers) to show many content. For some reason, the script missed the point and it showed another panel at right side. It was not hidden properly or closed.\nThe wrong panel is even interactable (inside canvas area).\nHopefully script can adjusted a bit to reduce this bug chance.\nAfter reopening menu, it's gone. But bug is bug, and it's also kinda dirty.\nLink to clip bug: https://clips.twitch.tv/BlightedDeafTireStinkyCheese-DaacmlZRVrju7Ly6",
